{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sealed domain was once created for warriors to battle without fear of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of a way to extend her master\u2019s dying breath, a lone wolf ventures into the unknown\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you need to defeat your opponents is already within you. There are no upgrades, no levels, no equipment, only your own skills and how you use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/f95a8aafb21dc385a703ebb9f62133b9.poster.avif?t=1767372843\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/f95a8aafb21dc385a703ebb9f62133b9.webm?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/f95a8aafb21dc385a703ebb9f62133b9.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parry (Almost) Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly every attack can be parried, if you\u2019re brave and precise enough to learn how.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/e1789602d5f60998130fbfd1c308b429.poster.avif?t=1767372843\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/e1789602d5f60998130fbfd1c308b429.webm?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/e1789602d5f60998130fbfd1c308b429.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Duel Opponents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors and masters from various eras and regions all find themselves trapped within. Each bring their own unique approach to combat for you to overcome in intense, fast-paced battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/71684d283365c409daff60c4bc7f7882.poster.avif?t=1767372843\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/71684d283365c409daff60c4bc7f7882.webm?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/71684d283365c409daff60c4bc7f7882.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Balance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between duels, take your time to relax, recharge, and seek advice on the perils ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/6e67e677ccfa6ff8af0c4b8d3bc5c1fb.poster.avif?t=1767372843\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/6e67e677ccfa6ff8af0c4b8d3bc5c1fb.webm?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/6e67e677ccfa6ff8af0c4b8d3bc5c1fb.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like you, defeat is not the end for your opponents. Whether you choose to befriend them or not, the path you must walk remains the same. The destination, on the other hand\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/dbe24433b95e60c9fb3f1932c2e147a3.poster.avif?t=1767372843\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/dbe24433b95e60c9fb3f1932c2e147a3.webm?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/dbe24433b95e60c9fb3f1932c2e147a3.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action combat against a linear gauntlet of 7+ bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All abilities are unlocked from the start, no grinding necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic hub dialogue interactions that evolve as you progress through the game to unlock optional character stories and interactions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692670?t=1767372843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/9f4397ff6194290179ebbe3f58a27dfdc2cbef67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767372843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/254e21915c611d02c636c3e00a162fe2941e9dc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767372843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/254e21915c611d02c636c3e00a162fe2941e9dc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767372843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable wit