xtras/6e67e677ccfa6ff8af0c4b8d3bc5c1fb.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like you, defeat is not the end for your opponents. Whether you choose to befriend them or not, the path you must walk remains the same. The destination, on the other hand\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/dbe24433b95e60c9fb3f1932c2e147a3.poster.avif?t=1767372843\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/dbe24433b95e60c9fb3f1932c2e147a3.webm?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/dbe24433b95e60c9fb3f1932c2e147a3.mp4?t=1767372843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action combat against a linear gauntlet of 7+ bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All abilities are unlocked from the start, no grinding necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic hub dialogue interactions that evolve as you progress through the game to unlock optional character stories and interactions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["kemomimic"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/f0becb24ab97076b973a5fe518621b81e95c87f4/header.jpg?t=1767372843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"